OL,3,GNEWSABurnham - Rosebank and Jackdaw oil
OL,4,Aand gas decisions coming 'shortly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said a
OL,7,Fdecision on whether to give the
OL,8,Fgo-ahead to two oil and gas fields will
OL,9,Fbe made "shortly".
OL,11,FBurnham has been deliberating over
OL,12,Fplans for Rosebank, an oil field off
OL,13,FShetland, and gas field Jackdaw, east
OL,14,Fof Aberdeen - with a decision on the
OL,15,Flatter "imminent", according to the
OL,16,Fenergy secretary.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
