OL,3,GNEWSABurnham - Rosebank and Jackdaw oil
OL,4,Aand gas decisions coming 'shortly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe controversial fields have been the
OL,7,Fsubject of years of debates, legal
OL,8,Fwrangling and public consultations,
OL,9,Fwith arguments from both industry
OL,10,Fbodies and environmentalists being
OL,11,Fweighed up by the UK government.
OL,13,FSpeaking at Prime Minister's Questions,
OL,14,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch urged
OL,15,FBurnham "to stop faffing about" when it
OL,16,Fcomes to the North Sea drilling.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
